.DS_Store

# Skill-local runtime caches and virtualenvs
**/.runtime/
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# Generated logs
**/last-error.log

# Browser auth/session state that may contain tokens
**/playwright/.auth/
**/storage-state*.json
**/auth-state*.json
**/*.session.json

# Private skill configuration and generated state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
agent-skills.env.zsh
**/env.local.zsh
**/.archive/
**/.curator_backups/
**/.hub/
**/.usage.json*
**/.bundled_manifest
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# Private configuration at its canonical location, if accidentally copied here
**/agent-skills/env.zsh
**/.curator_ledger.jsonl
**/.curator_state
**/.offline-*/
